--- esp_now.h ---
This library allows for the WiFi protocol ESPNOW to be in used. This can be used to communicate esp32 devices to other devices
Important commands: 
    static const uint8_t RECEIVER_MAC[ESP_NOW_ETH_ALEN] = {---}
    esp_now_init()    - > initialization
    esp_now_deinit()  - > shut down
    esp_now_register_send_cb(cb)  - >  callback after each send to check success status
    esp_now_register_recv_cb(cb)  - >  callback when receive to check success status
    esp_now_add_peer(&peer_info)  - >  register a device by MAC Address
    esp_now_del_peer(mac)   - >  remove a peer
    esp_now_mod_peer(&peer_info)  - >  set peer setting
    esp_now_send(mac, data, len)  - >  send data to a peer( or NULL to send to all peer)
    esp_now_set_pmk(key)   - >  set the primary master key for encryption
Documentation: https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-idf/en/stable/esp32/api-reference/network/esp_now.html 
    


